  "description": "Schnee, a mutant snow fox whose entire body radiates warmth, longs for the human world and makes a deal with a wizard to become human. Just as she is about to be disappointed that her innate warmth prevents her from becoming a true human, she unexpectedly encounters Lian, a Grand Duke whose entire body is freezing due to the wrath of the Snow Queen. The moment she sees Lian's powerful chill, a brilliant idea crosses Schnee's mind: That night, Schnee kisses the sleeping Lian and greedily absorbs the chill flowing through his body. But then... The man who was fast asleep opens his eyes.\nSource: MU",
